    {
      "text": "gospel to be proclaimed before kings and rulers, D&C 1:23. Saints shall have no king nor ruler, D&C 38:21. the Lord will be his people’s ruler when he comes, D&C 41:4. faithful shall be made ruler over many things, D&C 52:13. let no man think he is ruler, D&C 58:20. Saints to be made rulers over many kingdoms, D&C 78:15. Saints to importune rulers for redress, D&C 101:76. rulers to hear and know that which they have never considered, D&C 101:94. the Lord appoints Joseph Smith ruler over many things, D&C 132:53. rulers to protect innocent, D&C 134:6–7. noble and great spirits chosen in beginning to be rulers in Church, D&C 138:55.",
